#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:5
#: b4aabb7fe9484b5f88ec0a36de926830
msgid "Limit Cycle Detection"
msgstr "极限环检测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:7
#: 3001a5fea954484ea7e1da3710172626
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a limit cycle detection feature to help reduce or "
"eliminate oscillations in the control loops due to excessive tuning gains. "
"The algorithm monitors the actuator slew rates, and if above limits set by "
"the _SMAX parameters, will lower the control loop gains in an attempt to "
"stop the oscillations. These parameters are:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot提供极限环检测功能，用于减少或消除因调参增益过大而导致的控制回路振荡。该算法监测执行器的变化率，如果超过_SMAX参数设定的限制，将降低控制回路增益以尝试停止振荡。相关参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:9
#: 420ebdadc02d4fa8bd14bf98a71bff4b
msgid ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_SMAX<PTCH_RATE_SMAX>` for pitch"
msgstr ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_SMAX<PTCH_RATE_SMAX>`（用于俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:10
#: 20b0e72034374468a34109592b49c880
msgid ":ref:`RLL_RATE_SMAX<RLL_RATE_SMAX>` for roll"
msgstr ":ref:`RLL_RATE_SMAX<RLL_RATE_SMAX>`（用于横滚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:12
#: 80291510d5504bffa58370f7d9a639fc
msgid "for the Pitch and Roll control surface detection limits on fixed wing."
msgstr "适用于固定翼俯仰和横滚控制面的检测限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:16
#: b94bcebff8bd42878672a6bfac55efe8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The limit should be set to no more than 25% of the actuator's maximum slew "
"rate to allow for load effects."
msgstr "限制值应设置为不超过执行器最大变化率的25%，以留出负载效应的余量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:19
#: f6d69c582df64f729c3e3a6703379962
msgid ""
"For example, for most servos which specify a 0.1s speed for 60 deg "
"deflection (600deg/s), the value should be no more than 150, which is the "
"default."
msgstr "例如，对于大多数规格为 60 度偏转需 0.1 秒（600度/秒）的舵机，该值不应超过 150，这也是默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:21
#: 18717afcc5074936b98c56059cd8e9da
msgid ""
"For QuadPlane actuators (motors,surfaces,tilt servos depending on frame "
"type):"
msgstr "对于 QuadPlane 执行器（根据机架类型可能是电机、控制面或倾转舵机）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:23
#: afe40e15e92e4f78a7e901341578f865
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_PIT_SMAX>` for VTOL pitch"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_PIT_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_PIT_SMAX>`（用于 VTOL 俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:24
#: b2ac6582d1fc44e58cbfc247b92d436f
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_RLL_SMAX>` for VTOL roll"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_RLL_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_RLL_SMAX>`（用于 VTOL 横滚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:25
#: 556c097599ed41d5b9f4a80eb530d6b4
msgid ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_YAW_SMAX>` for VTOL yaw"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_SMAX<Q_A_RAT_YAW_SMAX>`（用于 VTOL 偏航）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:26
#: 6d8aabefe1014efbb2ac89a1b40dae1f
msgid ":ref:`Q_P_ACCZ_SMAX<Q_P_ACCZ_SMAX>` for VTOL position control"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_P_ACCZ_SMAX<Q_P_ACCZ_SMAX>`（用于 VTOL 位置控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:28
#: 78bc2f2f328b42da9f4ab8590659d256
msgid ""
"These are in different units (full activations per second), and have 50 as "
"the default, which effectively de-activates them because they are too high. "
"Currently, setting these such that they are active interferes with the "
"QAUTOTUNE and this will be corrected in the future, but it allows logging of"
" the actual slew rates in the PIQx.SRate log messages."
msgstr ""
"这些值单位不同（每秒完整动作次数），默认值为 50，实际上处于非激活状态，因为该值过高。目前，将这些值设为激活状态会干扰 "
"QAUTOTUNE，未来将修复此问题，但它允许在 PIQx.SRate 日志消息中记录实际转换率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-limit-cycle-detection.rst:30
#: 494f11a3686e4685a335fc7fb9a00b0b
msgid ""
"When these values are exceeded, the appropriate PID Dmod log data ( "
"PIDR.Dmod, PIQP.DMod, etc.)will show values spiking below 1 in the plots, "
"indicating lowered gains. An ideal tune, will have this occur very "
"occasionally during operation, but not frequently. By examining the logged "
"PIDx.SRate messages one can see the actual slew rates being used and set "
"these _ SMAX values appropriately to be at or slightly above the general "
"peak slew rates."
msgstr ""
"当这些值被超过时，相应的PID "
"Dmod日志数据（PIDR.Dmod、PIQP.DMod等）将在图表中显示低于1的峰值，表示增益已降低。理想的调参结果应使此情况偶尔出现，而不是频繁发生。通过查看日志中的PIDx.SRate消息，可以看到实际使用的变化率，并相应地将这些_SMAX值设置为等于或略高于一般峰值变化率。"

